{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "flashcard-gen-001",
		"name": "Quizify - Flashcard Generation & Management",
		"description": "Complete test suite for flashcard generation, deck management, study sessions, and export functionality.\n\n**Feature Overview:**\n- Generate AI-powered flashcards from text, files, or URLs\n- Two generation modes: Standard (1 credit) and Enhanced (2 credits)\n- Enhanced mode: RAG-based with concept extraction and Bloom's taxonomy\n- Card styles: question_answer, term_definition, cloze, mixed\n- Difficulty levels: easy, medium, hard, mixed\n- Spaced repetition study sessions\n- Export to Anki (TSV) or PDF\n\n**Generation Modes:**\n- `standard`: Fast, direct LLM generation (default, 1 credit)\n- `enhanced`: RAG pipeline with concept extraction, Bloom's taxonomy levels, and higher quality (2 credits)\n\n**API Prefix:** `/api/flashcards`\n\n**Setup Instructions:**\n1. Set `{{base_url}}` variable (e.g., http://localhost:8000)\n2. Set `{{auth_token}}` variable with your JWT token\n3. Run endpoints in order (some depend on previous responses)\n\n**Endpoints Covered:**\n- POST /generate/text - Generate from text content\n- POST /generate/file - Generate from uploaded file\n- POST /generate/url - Generate from web URL\n- GET /decks - List user's flashcard decks\n- GET /decks/{deck_id} - Get deck with cards\n- PATCH /decks/{deck_id} - Update deck\n- DELETE /decks/{deck_id} - Delete deck\n- PATCH /cards/{card_id} - Update card\n- DELETE /cards/{card_id} - Delete card\n- POST /study/start - Start study session\n- POST /study/complete - Complete session with results\n- POST /decks/{deck_id}/export - Export deck\n\n**Last Updated:** 2025-12-25",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
