			"name": "2. Flashcard Generation - Text",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Generate Flashcards from Text (Success)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Response has deck_id\", function () {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('deck_id');",
									"    pm.environment.set(\"deck_id\", jsonData.deck_id);",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Response has cards array\", function () {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('cards');",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.cards).to.be.an('array');",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.cards.length).to.be.greaterThan(0);",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Cards have front and back\", function () {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    var card = jsonData.cards[0];",
									"    pm.expect(card).to.have.property('front');",
									"    pm.expect(card).to.have.property('back');",
									"    pm.expect(card).to.have.property('id');",
									"    pm.environment.set(\"card_id\", card.id);",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Response has generation metadata\", function () {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('card_count');",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('generation_time_ms');",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('content_source_type');",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.content_source_type).to.eql('text');",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Response has generation mode\", function () {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('generation_mode');",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('credits_consumed');",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}",
								"type": "text"
							},
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json",
								"type": "text"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"content\": \"Python is a high-level, interpreted programming language known for its simplicity and readability. It was created by Guido van Rossum and first released in 1991. Python supports multiple programming paradigms including procedural, object-oriented, and functional programming. The language uses indentation to define code blocks instead of braces or keywords. Python has a large standard library and an extensive ecosystem of third-party packages available through PyPI (Python Package Index). It is widely used in web development, data science, artificial intelligence, scientific computing, and automation.\",\n  \"title\": \"Python Basics Flashcards\",\n  \"config\": {\n    \"num_cards\": 10,\n    \"include_hints\": true,\n    \"card_style\": \"mixed\",\n    \"difficulty\": \"medium\",\n    \"mode\": \"standard\"\n  }\n}",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/flashcards/generate/text",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "flashcards", "generate", "text"]
						},
						"description": "Generate flashcards from text content.\n\n**Authentication Required:** Bearer token in Authorization header\n\n**Request Body:**\n- content: Text content to generate flashcards from (min 50 chars, required)\n- title: Title for the deck (optional)\n- config: Generation configuration (optional)\n  - num_cards: Number of cards to generate (1-100, auto-calculated if null)\n  - include_hints: Whether to include hints (default: false)\n  - card_style: question_answer, term_definition, cloze, mixed (default: mixed)\n  - difficulty: easy, medium, hard, mixed (default: mixed)\n  - mode: standard (1 credit) or enhanced (2 credits, RAG-based)\n\n**Generation Modes:**\n- standard: Fast, direct LLM generation (default)\n- enhanced: RAG pipeline with concept extraction, Bloom's taxonomy\n\n**Success Response (200):**\n```json\n{\n  \"deck_id\": \"uuid\",\n  \"deck_title\": \"Deck Title\",\n  \"cards\": [...],\n  \"card_count\": 10,\n  \"content_source_type\": \"text\",\n  \"generation_time_ms\": 2500,\n  \"estimated_study_time_minutes\": 5,\n  \"generation_mode\": \"standard\",\n  \"generation_stats\": {},\n  \"credits_consumed\": 1\n}\n```\n\n**Error Responses:**\n- 401: Unauthorized (missing/invalid token)\n- 402: Insufficient credits\n- 422: Validation error (content too short)"
					},
					"response": []
				},
